        "rawMarkdown": "Hi, the best submission score is actually 1.1, not 1, so it is possible for the scores to go over 1. In fact it is theoretically possible to obtain a score slightly above 1.1 (due to our adjusted jaccard metric) but we don't expect to happen. \nOur metrics are detailed here https://github.com/royerlab/kaggle-cell-tracking-competition/blob/main/metrics.md",
